### Health
GET http://localhost:8080/health

### Upload clean fixture
POST http://localhost:8080/receipts
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=boundary

--boundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="file"; filename="receipt-clean.txt"
Content-Type: text/plain

< ./src/main/resources/fixtures/receipt-clean.txt
--boundary--

### Set IDs returned by upload/process before running the requests below
@receiptId = REPLACE_ME
@transactionId = REPLACE_ME

### Process receipt
POST http://localhost:8080/receipts/{{receiptId}}/process

### Get transaction
GET http://localhost:8080/transactions/{{transactionId}}

### Re-itemize from stored OCR
POST http://localhost:8080/transactions/{{transactionId}}/itemize

### Valid merge-style item replacement
PATCH http://localhost:8080/transactions/{{transactionId}}/items
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "items": [
    {"description": "Coffee and sandwich", "amount": 12.40},
    {"description": "Mineral water", "amount": 2.60}
  ]
}

### Invalid replacement -> 409 Conflict
PATCH http://localhost:8080/transactions/{{transactionId}}/items
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "items": [
    {"description": "Coffee", "amount": 2.00}
  ]
}
